  "_why_host": "P3331 (16/11/2026 Paris, owner decision): kind \"host\" carries a held driver whose couples are free on the payload inside a published DORMANT host (hosts below: its own couples are fake or unpairable, so no real device is paired on it). The class may differ: the hosted device runs the held driver device class, migrates its class once and keeps exactly the held capability set. The held driver settings are appended to the host entry and its flow cards are re-targeted to the host (same card ids). Exact couples resolve by manufacturerName + productId (trimmed, case-insensitive).",
